# truck_tracking.func

> Module: truck_tracking (Kamyon Takip) | Category: FLEET

## Purpose
Vehicle fleet management. Track all company trucks with plate numbers, brands, models, years, and GPS tracking source configurations. Core module for logistics companies.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish trucking companies need a central registry of their vehicle fleet
- Each truck needs tracking with unique plate number (Turkish format: NN AAA NNNN)
- Plan-based limits: FREE = 5 trucks, PRO = 10, PREMIUM = unlimited
- Multiple tracking sources: manual, GPS device, mobile app

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `trucks`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| plaka | VARCHAR(20) | Turkish plate (UNIQUE per tenant) |
| marka | VARCHAR(100) | Brand (Mercedes, MAN, Volvo, etc.) |
| model | VARCHAR(100) | Model name |
| yil | INTEGER | Year |
| tracking_source | tracking_source_enum | MANUEL / GPS_CIHAZ / MOBIL_UYGULAMA |
| yakit_tipi | fuel_type_enum | DIZEL / BENZIN / LPG / ELEKTRIK |
| km | INTEGER | Current odometer reading |
| aktif | BOOLEAN | Active status |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enum types:**
- `tracking_source_enum`: MANUEL, GPS_CIHAZ, MOBIL_UYGULAMA
- `fuel_type_enum`: DIZEL, BENZIN, LPG, ELEKTRIK

**RLS:** Enabled (tenant isolation)

**Related tables:** trips, maintenance_records, fuel_logs, toll_logs (all linked by truck_id/arac_id)

## User Interface
**TrucksPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/trucks`
- DataGrid table with columns: Plaka, Marka, Model, Yıl, Yakıt Tipi, Takip Kaynağı, KM
- Add/Edit modal (plaka, marka, model, yıl, yakit_tipi, tracking_source, km)
- Delete with confirmation dialog
- Bulk select + bulk delete
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF via DataGrid
- Search/filter functionality
- Plan limit indicator

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/trucks/` | Tenant JWT | List trucks (filterable) |
| POST | `/api/tenant/trucks/` | Tenant JWT | Add truck (plan limit enforced) |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/trucks/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit truck |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/trucks/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove truck |

## Known Bugs
- All known bugs fixed (early bug: tracking_source enum rejected empty string, B1 fixed May 25)
- Plan limit enforcement functional

## Test Coverage
- QA test: 6/6 passed (100%)
- Full CRUD cycle verified: Create → List → Edit → Delete
- CI gate: handler count + endpoint count checks
